3:     3	> Status: foundation frozen, October 20, 2026. D149 adds extraction-owned grouping; D165 puts it in the default pipeline. D169: the matching step runs on Jev by default (`poc-v23`); D168 states the Replace row's full definition and the succession answer it needs. English edition: October 25, 2026 (D163). Only recorded decisions apply; open questions and two pull-mode proposals remain separate.
