expectations with no stated timing, financing or NVIDIA share of the purchase, so they do not establish NVDA order volume.\",\"Sharon AI's quote gives no quantities, dates or contract terms, so it supports only that a collaboration was announced.\",\"NVIDIA is the publisher and original speaker, so the source is a self-description of its own model and is not independently confirmed.\"],\"follow_up\":[\"Check NVIDIA's next annual or quarterly filing for disclosure of the revenue-sharing or credit-support arrangements, including any receivable, guarantee or deferred revenue lines tied to AI cloud counterparties.\",\"Check Firmus and Sharon AI announcements or regulatory filings for signing status, financing sources and timing of the NVIDIA-linked capacity.\",\"Check subsequent Firmus Batam campus progress reporting for megawatts energized and GPU deployments against the stated expectations of 360 MW and 170,000 GPUs.\"],\"proposal\":null}"
